OL,3,AGoogle Cloud says outage affecting
OL,4,Abanks and court video links caused by
OL,5,A'power event'
OL,6,
OL,7,FGoogle says "multiple" Cloud services
OL,8,Fare still experiencing issues after a
OL,9,F"power event"
OL,11,FDue to the unspecified event, Google
OL,12,Fsays "we had suffered an outage within
OL,13,Feurope-west2-b zone", adding it's now
OL,14,F"mitigated" - our tech reporter
OL,15,Fexplains what this means
OL,17,FOnline bank Revolut, delivery service
OL,18,FDPD and Royal Mail are among the
OL,19,Fbusinesses reporting issues, according
OL,20,Fto Downdetector - here are some others
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
